{
  "_doc": [
    "Sprites: height is a fraction of screen height; frames animate at fps; spin = pre-rendered rotation steps;",
    "anim = folder of baked clips (tools/bake), directions = 4 rotated variants instead of a mirror;",
    "flap / flicker = fake wing beat / candle light from a single drawing (flicker_min: from that level on; 99 = off).",
    "Elements: min/max = level range where it appears: 1 = now and then one decoration … 7 = the day before,",
    "8 = the day itself (9 = demo grid of all sprites). count/max_active/every grow from min to 'full' (default 8).",
    "video_min = from which level it also shows over a playing video (default never).",
    "band = keep to the left/right screen edges (below 8). hz = redraw rate (default 15, particles 12).",
    "say = speech balloon (only when themes_text is on).",
    "Types: decor (always there), visitor (comes and goes: cast of sprite+anchor+places), particles, flyer, walker,",
    "dropper (spider on a thread), crawler (baked walker), performer (baked character scene), peeker,",
    "weaver (a spider building a web in a top corner), prowler (a black cat strolling along the bottom).",
    "group = exclusive category (on an element or a cast entry): one spider, one bat, one flyer... at a time;",
    "walker and flying are one at a time in the whole room, not just on a screen.",
    "meets = [types]: may come while one of these is on the screen (the zombie and the others: they react to",
    "each other); the two then stay on this screen (they don't walk on to the next).",
    "on decor: one element of the group per screen (one pumpkin set, left or right corner).",
    "crawler wander = [s, s]: an erratic path (a new direction every 'turn' s), then out at the top or bottom.",
    "walker/crawler/performer passing a tombstone: grave_chance (0.35) to drop into the grave; graves = false: never.",
    "frankenstein: shocks himself at a stop, at the last one he blows apart (explode = false: walks off).",
    "vampire, mummy, zombie: baked scenes (themes/engine.lua). zombie: thought = its brain thought sprite; invite =",
    "[{type, sprite, chance, after}]: when it comes, maybe one of these comes soon too, walker group or not (the",
    "vampire and the cat run past a zombie, it reaches for them; a skeleton gets a crossed-out brain).",
  "Several screens in a room: walkers (zombie, frankenstein, a skeleton: walk_on = chance, default 0.5) and the cat",
  "walking off towards a screen next door go on there; so do a coffin pushed off, frankenstein's head, the mummy's helper.",
    "flyer: y = height in the middle of the screen, bend = how much lower towards the sides (an arc, the middle stays clear);",
    "a sprite with depth = {min, steps} drifts nearer and farther while it flies (smaller = farther = slower).",
    "cast near_logo: true = hang from the top edge somewhere around/over the watermark logo.",
    "solid: true = the cat can climb onto it (pumpkins, tombstones, the coffin).",
    "decor duty {on, off} (seconds): it sinks away and comes back now and then; aside: makes way (sinks away) while a big scene is on the floor (\"scenes\": the witch's cauldron, the coffin, the sarcophagus, the frankenstein) or also while anyone else not from a grave is about (\"others\": the tombstone stays for skeletons and zombies)."
  ],
